  "notes": "Vanilla Enhancement at 60: totems dropped before the pull, Stormstrike on cooldown, Flame Shock kept ticking, Earth Shock as the mana dump -- matching the community guide's 'totems > Stormstrike > Flame Shock (dot) > Frost/Earth Shock' summary. The fork's enhancement_shaman/apls/default.apl.json is the starting point, with two fixes: it casts Stormstrike (17364) at rank 1, but this build's spellconst has 17364 at rank 0 -- a stale label the rank-check test exists to catch -- so the rank is dropped here entirely, the same way a rankless spell like Tiger's Fury is written. It also checks Windfury Totem's remaining uptime against a second aura id (10611) that this build's spellconst does not have at all, so re-casting it here just checks the totem's own cast id instead, the same self-referential pattern the preset already uses for Strength of Earth and Grace of Air. Kept the preset's Searing Totem-only-with-20+-seconds-left and mana-percent-gated Earth Shock filler unchanged.",
